{
  "title": "UC-119 · Trazabilidad LLM (Prompts, Recuperaciones, Herramientas, Trazas)",
  "uid": "uc119-traceability",
  "tags": ["uc-119", "llm-observability", "traceability"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(llm_traced_requests_total, model)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Solicitudes con traza completa registrada",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(llm_traced_requests_total{model=~\"$model\"}[5m])) by (model)", "legendFormat": "{{model}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Llamadas a herramientas/APIs por estado",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(llm_tool_calls_total{model=~\"$model\"}[5m])) by (tool, status)", "legendFormat": "{{tool}}-{{status}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Pasos de agente (P50/P95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(llm_agent_steps_bucket{model=~\"$model\"}[5m])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "p50 {{model}}" },
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(llm_agent_steps_bucket{model=~\"$model\"}[5m])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "p95 {{model}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Motivo de finalización (finish reason)",
      "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(increase(llm_finish_reason_total{model=~\"$model\"}[1h])) by (finish_reason)", "legendFormat": "{{finish_reason}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Trazas en Tempo (Explore)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Para inspeccionar trazas individuales (spans `llm_monitor_request`, atributos `request_id`/`model`), use **Grafana Explore** con el datasource **Tempo** filtrando por `request_id`. Para logs estructurados JSON correlacionados, use el datasource **Loki** con `{job=\"uc-119\"} | json | request_id=\"<id>\"`."
      }
    }
  ]
}
